  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp; Third Wave Water is a product designed for coffee enthusiasts, particularly those who are passionate about achieving the best possible flavor in their coffee brewing. It is a water mineral supplement specifically formulated to enhance the quality of water used in brewing coffee.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The name \"Third Wave Water\" refers to the third wave coffee movement, which is characterized by a focus on high-quality, artisanal coffee, with an emphasis on the origin of the beans, the roasting process, and the brewing method. Third Wave Water aims to address the importance of water quality in coffee brewing, as water composition can significantly impact the taste of the final cup.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The product typically comes in the form of small capsules or powder packets that users can add to distilled or reverse osmosis water. The minerals in Third Wave Water are carefully measured to create an ideal balance, mimicking the mineral content found in renowned coffee-producing regions. This helps to enhance the extraction of flavors from coffee beans and contributes to a more consistent and improved brewing experience.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">It's worth noting that water quality is a critical factor in coffee brewing, and variations in mineral content can affect the taste, acidity, and overall profile of the coffee. Third Wave Water provides a convenient way for coffee enthusiasts to ensure that their brewing water is optimized for extracting the best flavors from their coffee beans.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description: Mineral powder suppliments for improving the taste of coffee, protecting your expensive coffee equipment and even lowering the acidity of coffee.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): <br>&bull; Payment terms: 30 DaYS<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n</div>",
